      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town incorporated on December 31 1997, became a city in 2001, and has expanded rapidly along Utah Lake’s northwestern shore.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        17,
