      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saratoga_Springs%2C_Utah",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "A Church of Jesus Christ of Latter‑Day Saints temple was announced for Saratoga Springs in 2008 and dedicated on August 13 2023 after an open house from April to July.",
